<title>SOUTH KOREA: BOK intevenes in forward trading, selling $40 mln.</title>
<headline>BOK intevenes in forward trading, selling $40 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central Bank of Korea (BOK) sold $20 million in both three-month and six-month forward trading Wednesday morning to cap the won's fall against the U.S. dollar, dealers said.</p>
</text>
